# Steady state hypothesis (SSH) of frame s1-f2, normal operation: the p and q of its loads, and nothing
# else. The feeder has no switch: its breaker is in the substation frame and its tie in the boundary.
# Load it after the frame's structural model.

Profile = cim18v17

Update Table EnergyConsumer: mRID, p (kW), q (kvar)
    ld_s1_f2_mid, 800, 200
    ld_s1_f2_end, 500, 120
